# Dump DB va log runtime cua GServer: sinh moi lan chay, ten co timestamp nen
# moi lan lai la mot file moi. Khong ignore thi `git add -A` nuot ca dump chua
# mat khau, email, so dien thoai va IP cua nguoi choi.
#
# Migration schema nam o SRCGOPETGOC/MariaDB_SQL/migration-*.sql (docker/migrate-db.sh).
SRCGOPETGOC/GServer/backup_sql/*.sql
SRCGOPETGOC/GServer/backup_sql/*.sql.partial-*
SRCGOPETGOC/GServer/log/
SRCGOPETGOC/GServer/history-spool/

# Python bytecode cache cua tools/image-gen
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Backup DB tren may chu (docker/migrate-db.sh, cron muc 8 docs/deployment-linux-backend.md):
